.history

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Maintainer feedback-to-specs input (local triage only; the specs it produces are committed).
# The glob covers the numbered variants a multi-bootcamp triage round produces
# (…_01.md, …_13.md), not just the bare filename.
# Root-anchored on purpose: the transient working copy is ignored, while the processed
# archive under feedback/ IS tracked, so a raw report survives an overwrite.
/SENZING_BOOTCAMP_PLUGIN_FEEDBACK*.md
